Their counters receive an unsigned narrow helper result into a wider signed
destination. Once initialized/updated, the negative exit value is unreachable;
the inspected loop bodies do not modify that counter or break/return.
The tests exhaust u8 transitions and check their finite cycles; u16/u32
controls cover wrap boundaries, accompanied by the source type-range argument.
This does not prove the whole program free of undefined behavior, nor yield
a common terminating checksum. Together with the earlier paths, 19 identities
have repeating source paths identified and 49 remain undetermined; all 68
retain oracle-unusable. No original source, seed, timeout or receipt changes.
